### Flutter Profile Validation Tests
### This file tests the Flutter-specific validation endpoints

### 1. Valid profile data
POST http://localhost:8080/api/profile/flutter/validate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "userName": "Александр",
  "heightCm": 175,
  "weightKg": 70,
  "age": 25,
  "activityLevel": "MODERATE",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "dailyStepGoal": 10000
}

### 2. Invalid name (too short)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/profile/flutter/validate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "userName": "А",
  "heightCm": 175,
  "weightKg": 70,
  "age": 25,
  "activityLevel": "MODERATE",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "dailyStepGoal": 10000
}

